+# Password Hashing Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to hash passwords with argon2id, chosen because its memory-hardness makes it much more resistant to GPU-based attacks. No specific parameters (memory cost, iterations, parallelism) have been recorded, so none are specified here.
